name low_fps_clean_link
describe 15 fps video on a clean 1.5 Mbps / 100 ms RTT link: audio delay and queue twice the 30 fps values, as in libwebrtc (issue #258)
duration 60s
video_fps 15
at 0s capacity=1500kbps delay=50ms
# libwebrtc M157 on this link (sm_compare, yardstick PR #275, seeds 1-10):
# mouth-to-ear p95 384-502 ms (mean 446), queue p95 89-130 ms (mean 106),
# concealed 0.3-0.5 %, no freezes. At 30 fps both stacks give about half
# (235 ms, 44 ms). Bounds sit just above libwebrtc's worst seed.
expect audio.mouth_to_ear_p95_ms < 510
expect cc.queue_p95_ms < 140
expect audio.concealed_pct < 1
expect video.freeze_count == 0
expect video.render_fps >= 14.5
